+// VR R0 (D-099..D-102, docs/VR-R0-FINDINGS.md): the VR mode's eye law. While
+// pdVisionVRActive() is 1 the shell has published, per eye, the head-to-eye
+// transform E (game view space -> eye space, PD units, ROW-vector) and the
